; 1. 제32회 대한민국 청소년가족 가훈공모대전 요강 1부.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. 출품원서(청소년용) 1부.&nbsp; 끝.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
